l><li>In a cabinet on the second floor of the <a href=\"/wiki/Highberry%27s_Home\" title=\"Highberry's Home\">Highberrys' Home</a> <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;10&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;-45</span></li></ul>\n</div>  <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Text\"> Text </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-book-text\">\n<p>[A Lathanderian prayerbook - the dust on its cover seems to catch every errant beam of sunlight.]\n</p><p><br>\nLo, <a href=\"/wiki/Lathander\" title=\"Lathander\">Morninglord</a>! Hear us cry! Let us too be wardens of creation - let us bless your world with child. Light our wandering way.\n</p><p><br>\nConsecrate our union, Morninglord, we pray, bless our bond with the life you would have us bring. Light our wandering way.\n</p><p><br>\n[The rest of the prayers follow a very similar tact.]\n</p>\n</div>    \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714203340\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.051 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.053 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1595/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 29689/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 7786/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 29/200\nExpensive parser function count: 2/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.011/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 936341/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   41.822      1 Template:MiscItemPage\n100.00%   41.822      1 -total\n 56.82%   23.762      7 Template:Icon_text\n 50.74%   21.221     17 Template:Trim\n 22.57%    9.440      2 Template:Uid\n 15.95%    6.670      1 Template:Main_only\n 13.74%    5.746      2 Template:Icon_link\n 13.18%    5.514      2 Template:Template_style\n 10.89%    4.553      1 Template:Books\n 10.61%    4.437      1 Template:Ifexist\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:30842-0!canoni